    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T. projects: Bell Labs engineer Harold Hodges on building the electronics of Rauschenberg's Oracle with Billy Kl\u00fcver, and on his work for 9 Evenings: radio-controlled platforms, the Mylar blimp for Kisses Sweeter Than Wine, and Open Score."
      }
