    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Yvonne Rainer recalls her 1971 trip to India and the dance Grand Union Dreams it led to, and the everyday objects and Carl Andre's Styrofoam beams in her 9 Evenings piece Carriage Discreteness at the Armory, 1966."
      }
    ]
