    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: in January 1968 Stanley Landsman says he has never dealt with E.A.T. despite Marian Javits's efforts, reacts to its mailing inviting him to join, and doubts that artist-scientist pairings or 'collaboration' work."
      }
    ]
