    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About an E.A.T. project: Alex Hay recalls making Grass Field for 9 Evenings (1966), with body-sound amplifiers and transmitters built by Bell Labs engineer L. J. Robinson, Billy Kl\u00fcver as liaison, and Steve Paxton's late start."
      }
    ]
