    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About an E.A.T. project: Lewis Lloyd recalls watching 9 Evenings at the 69th Regiment Armory in 1966, his doubts about Billy Kl\u00fcver's engineers, Rauschenberg's Open Score, and David Tudor and Gordon Mumma wiring equipment."
      }
    ]
