    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About an E.A.T. project: Walter De Maria calls Robert Whitman's work assembling musicians, designers and sound people for the E.A.T. Pepsi Pavilion at Expo '70 in Osaka a mistake, since it served Pepsi, which shut it after a few months."
      }
    ]
