    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: John Giorno, asked by Rob Pruitt whether Dial-a-Poem was a new use of technology, recalls Robert Rauschenberg starting E.A.T. in 1966 to team artists with engineers, and judges that many of its objects were failures."
      }
    ]
