    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About an E.A.T. project: Forrest Myers recalls Billy Kl\u00fcver of E.A.T. helping Andy Warhol make the floating Silver Clouds, and his own work with Kl\u00fcver on the Moon Museum, sent to the moon on Apollo 12 in 1969."
      }
    ]
