    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Tom Patti recalls monthly E.A.T. meetings where he met Robert Rauschenberg, carrying its small publication around New York and to his school as E.A.T.'s student representative, and its later Expo '70 work."
      }
