    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Carolee Schneemann recalls James Tenney's job as a composer at Bell Telephone Labs, where he worked with Billy Kl\u00fcver, and Kl\u00fcver sending her to perform in Claes Oldenburg's happening Store Days (1962)."
      }
