      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Max Mathews on John Pierce prompting Music I at Bell Labs in 1957, Music II to V, Jean-Claude Risset's work with him, Bell Labs research under William O. Baker, John Chowning's FM synthesis and IRCAM with Pierre Boulez."
      }
    ]
  },
