    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: John R. Pierce recalls how he and Max Mathews began computer sound synthesis at Bell Labs, leading to Mathews's Music IV and Music V, and describes his stretched-octave psychoacoustic experiments, to be continued at IRCAM."
      }
    ]
