    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Herwig Kogelnik recalls Rudolf Kompfner recruiting him from Oxford to Bell Labs, where from January 1961 he worked on making the Murray Hill gas laser practical, and how optical communications drove laser research there."
      }
    ]
