        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: an interviewer puts to Maurice Tuchman the charge that the cost of LACMA's Art and Technology exhibition turned the board against expensive contemporary shows; Tuchman cites modest proposals of his own."
      }
    ]
  },
