      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Robert Irwin on LACMA's Art and Technology programme as open inquiry rather than object-making, his perception experiments and long dialogue with Ed Wortz, meeting Richard Feynman, and the Habitability symposium he housed."
      }
