    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Deborah Hay recalls the preparations for 9 Evenings: Theatre and Engineering (1966) as a fiasco that taught her much, and getting to know John Cage and David Tudor there; she says Merce Cunningham had no part in it."
      }
    ]
