      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: critic Dore Ashton on Billy Kl\u00fcver and Julie Martin, on working with Kl\u00fcver as an informal partner on 9 Evenings and linking it to Jean Tinguely, and on seeing Rauschenberg's Open Score."
      }
    ]
