    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Mel Bochner recalls his E.A.T. projects: the Local One lithographers' school project with Marjorie Strider and Brice Marden, his 1968 Singer Labs residency in Denville, and an E.A.T. grant, crediting Francis Mason."
      }
