    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Sylvia Palacios Whitman says she had little to do with E.A.T., recalls months in Japan with Robert Whitman during Expo '70 and the Pepsi Pavilion, with Olga and Billy Kl\u00fcver's family, and praises Julie Martin."
      }
    ]
  },
