    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Takahashi, Rauschenberg's assistant on the Carnal Clocks (1969), recalls vaguely that Rauschenberg had E.A.T. and Billy Kl\u00fcver build the clocks' timing and switching machinery, as for Oracle."
      }
