    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Robert Petersen recalls organizing the 1970 Group Light Show in the Baldwin Hills with Laddie John Dill, Tim Isham and Daniel Freeman, his motorized mirror wheel, and Robert Rauschenberg's flashlight and water-box pieces."
      }
    ]
