      {
        "@value": "Asha and Suhrid Sarabhai, oral history interview by Cameron Vanderscoff and Gina Guy, March 18, 2015; November 18, 2015; and November 21 and 22, 2016, Oral History Project, Robert Rauschenberg Foundation Archives, New York."
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Asha Sarabhai says John Cage, David Tudor and Merce Cunningham were friends and guests of Manorama Sarabhai, and mentions Alexander Keefe's article on Tudor and the first Moog in India and Vikram Sarabhai's space research."
      }
    ]
  },
