    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Mayo Thompson recalls filming Rauschenberg's Oracle in Dallas, the work in which he sees Rauschenberg's interface with Billy Kl\u00fcver fully justified, and speaks warmly of Kl\u00fcver and Julie Martin."
      }
    ]
  },
