      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Lawrence Voytek recalls, at second hand, Rauschenberg's delight in the blueprints he made with Susan Weil and the wishes he put to Billy Kl\u00fcver, among them a light that would project darkness."
      }
    ]
